# Storyboard v3. beats | on screen | purpose | how it leaves | carried into next shot. Half beats allowed inside a chapter; chapter boundaries fall on whole beats. Scale tags CLOSE/WIDE/OVER/FULL/3D. [SIG1-3] mark signature moments. In 3D shots every label is HTML positioned from the scene each frame; cameras stay between 35 and 55 degrees.
## 0 Cold open | 0
3 | CLOSE frame one, finished: an issue card fills the frame — "Issue · open", corner tag "illustrative example", title `summarize([]) raises ZeroDivisionError`, body "Expected 0 for an empty list." | hook with a bug every engineer recognises | the card slides left and shrinks while a code panel sweeps in from the right | issue card
